#: ../../source/janim/components/component.rst:2
msgid "component"
msgstr "component"

#: ../../source/rst_utils/tip_of_complex.rst:3
msgid "这部分内容涉及 JAnim 实现原理，可能较为复杂，若没有研究源码的需求，你应酌情阅读"
msgstr ""
"This section covers the implementations of JAnim, which may be quite complex. If you do not have the need to delve into "
"the source code, you may choose to read it at your discretion."

#: janim.components.component.CheckComponentMethods:1 of
msgid "所有的 :class:`Component` 子类都会被检查是否实现了 ``copy``, ``_become`` 和 ``not_changed`` 方法"
msgstr ""
"All subclasses of :class:`Component` are checked to ensure that they implement the ``copy``, ``_become``, and "
"``not_changed`` methods."

#: janim.components.component.CheckComponentMethods:3 of
msgid "含义："
msgstr "Meaning:"

#: janim.components.component.CheckComponentMethods:5 of
msgid "``copy``:"
msgstr "``copy``:"

#: janim.components.component.CheckComponentMethods:7 of
msgid "调用该函数后，产生一份组件的拷贝"
msgstr "Calling this function produces a copy of the component."

#: janim.components.component.CheckComponentMethods:9 of
msgid ""
"在该函数中，应使用 ``cmpt_copy = super().copy()`` 得到拷贝的组件对象， 然后在这个对象的基础上，处理有关的拷贝操作，最后返"
"回 ``cmpt_copy`` 对象"
msgstr ""
"In this function, ``cmpt_copy = super().copy()`` should be used to obtain a copy of the component. The relevant copying "
"operations should then be performed on this object, and finally the ``cmpt_copy`` object should be returned."

#: janim.components.component.CheckComponentMethods:12 of
msgid "``_become``:"
msgstr "``_become``:"

#: janim.components.component.CheckComponentMethods:14 of
msgid "会以另外一个（大概率是同类型的组件，该行为暂未稳定，有待明确）组件作为入参"
msgstr ""
"Takes another component as an argument (most likely one of the same type; this behavior is not yet stable and may be "
"clarified in the future)."

#: janim.components.component.CheckComponentMethods:16 of
msgid ""
"在该函数中，应先使用 ``super()._become(other)`` 处理父类的逻辑（如果有）， 然后再进行当前组件的处理逻辑，最终确保当前组件"
"的数据变得和目标组件长得一样"
msgstr ""
"In this function, ``super()._become(other)`` should first be used to handle the parent class's logic (if it exists). The "
"current component's logic should then be handled, ultimately ensuring that the current component's data matches that of "
"the target component."

#: janim.components.component.CheckComponentMethods:19 of
msgid "``not_changed``:"
msgstr "``not_changed``:"

#: janim.components.component.CheckComponentMethods:21 of
msgid "该函数需要返回一个 ``bool`` 值，表示是否能确定该组件的数据没有发生过变更，用于侦测组件修改"
msgstr ""
"This function should return a ``bool`` indicating whether it can be determined that the component's data has not changed, "
"and is used to detect modifications to the component."

#: janim.components.component.CheckComponentMethods:23 of
msgid ""
"例如 ``Cmpt_Points`` 的 ``_points`` 数据在未变动时内部 NumPy 数据的 ``id`` 保持不变， 但是在发生修改后，就会成为完全不同 "
"``id`` 的 NumPy 数组"
msgstr ""
"For example, when the ``_points`` data of ``Cmpt_Points`` has not been modified, the ``id`` of its underlying NumPy array "
"remains unchanged. After the data is modified, however, it becomes a completely different NumPy array with a different "
"``id``."

#: janim.components.component.CheckComponentMethods:26 of
msgid ""
"所以 ``Cmpt_Points`` 内部的 NumPy 数组只要无法通过 ``is`` 判断相同，他的该函数就会返回 ``False`` （哪怕变化后回到了相同值"
"的数据，也仍返回 ``False``）"
msgstr ""
"Therefore, ``Cmpt_Points`` returns ``False`` whenever its underlying NumPy arrays cannot be determined to be the same "
"using ``is`` (even if the data has been modified and then changed back to the same values, it will still return "
"``False``)."

#: janim.components.component.CheckComponentMethods:29 of
msgid "另外，对于未附加额外数据，仅提供额外方法的组件，可以用 ``impl=True`` 跳过该子类的检查"
msgstr ""
"Additionally, for components that do not contain any additional data and only provide additional methods, ``impl=True`` "
"can be used to skip the check for that subclass."

#: janim.components.component.Component.BindInfo:1 of
msgid "对组件定义信息的封装"
msgstr "Encapsulation of component definition information"

#: ../../source/janim/components/component.rst janim.components.component.Component.walk_same_cmpt_of_self_and_descendants
#: of
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: janim.components.component.Component.BindInfo:3 of
msgid ""
"以 ``xxx = CmptInfo(...)`` 的形式被声明在哪个类中； 如果一个类及其父类都有 ``xxx = CmptInfo(...)`` ，那么 ``decl_cls`` 是"
"父类"
msgstr ""
"The class in which it is declared in the form ``xxx = CmptInfo(...)``; if both a class and its parent class have ``xxx = "
"CmptInfo(...)``, then ``decl_cls`` is the parent class."

#: janim.components.component.Component.BindInfo:7 of
msgid "这个组件对象当前绑定到了哪个物件对象"
msgstr "The item object to which this component object is currently bound"

#: janim.components.component.Component.BindInfo:8 of
msgid "这个组件对象在物件中的变量名"
msgstr "The variable name of this component object within the item"

#: janim.components.component.CmptGroup:3 janim.components.component.CmptInfo:3
#: janim.components.component.Component.BindInfo:10 of
msgid "例："
msgstr "For example:"

#: janim.components.component.Component.BindInfo:12 of
msgid ""
"class MyCmpt(Component): ...\n"
"\n"
"class MyItem(Item):\n"
"    cmpt1 = CmptInfo(MyCmpt[Self])\n"
"    cmpt2 = CmptInfo(MyCmpt[Self])\n"
"\n"
"class MyItem2(MyItem):\n"
"    cmpt3 = CmptInfo(MyCmpt[Self])\n"
"\n"
"item = MyItem()\n"
"\n"
"# item.cmpt1.bind_info 与 BindInfo(MyItem, item, 'cmpt1') 一致\n"
"# item.cmpt2.bind_info 与 BindInfo(MyItem, item, 'cmpt2') 一致\n"
"\n"
"item2 = MyItem2()\n"
"\n"
"# item2.cmpt1.bind_info 与 BindInfo(MyItem, item2, 'cmpt1') 一致\n"
"# item2.cmpt3.bind_info 与 BindInfo(MyItem2, item2, 'cmpt3') 一致"
msgstr ""
"class MyCmpt(Component): ...\n"
"\n"
"class MyItem(Item):\n"
"    cmpt1 = CmptInfo(MyCmpt[Self])\n"
"    cmpt2 = CmptInfo(MyCmpt[Self])\n"
"\n"
"class MyItem2(MyItem):\n"
"    cmpt3 = CmptInfo(MyCmpt[Self])\n"
"\n"
"item = MyItem()\n"
"\n"
"# item.cmpt1.bind_info is consistent with BindInfo(MyItem, item, 'cmpt1')\n"
"# item.cmpt2.bind_info is consistent with BindInfo(MyItem, item, 'cmpt2')\n"
"\n"
"item2 = MyItem2()\n"
"\n"
"# item2.cmpt1.bind_info is consistent with BindInfo(MyItem, item2, 'cmpt1')\n"
"# item2.cmpt3.bind_info is consistent with BindInfo(MyItem2, item2, 'cmpt3')"

#: janim.components.component.Component.init_bind:1 of
msgid "用于 ``Item._init_components``"
msgstr "Used for ``Item._init_components``"

#: janim.components.component.Component.init_bind:3 of
msgid "子类可以继承该函数，进行与所在物件相关的处理"
msgstr "Subclasses can inherit this function to perform item-related processing"

#: janim.components.component.Component.get_same_cmpt:1 of
msgid "得到 ``item`` 物件中与自身同 ``self.bind.key`` 的组件，默认会创建 mock"
msgstr ""
"Get the component in the ``item`` object with the same ``self.bind.key`` as this component. By default, a mock will be "
"created if necessary."

#: janim.components.component.Component.get_same_cmpt:3 janim.components.component.Component.walk_same_cmpt_of_descendants:3
#: of
msgid ""
"注：若 ``self.bind`` 无效会由于尝试访问 ``None`` 的成员而抛出属性错误， 但是我们并没在函数中检查这一点；若有必要的话，预期"
"的做法是在函数外检查"
msgstr ""
"Note: If ``self.bind`` is invalid, an attribute error will be raised when attempting to access an attribute of ``None``. "
"However, this is not checked within the function; if necessary, the intended approach is to perform the check outside the "
"function."

#: janim.components.component.Component.get_same_cmpt:6 of
msgid "得到哪个物件中的组件"
msgstr "The item from which to get the component"

#: janim.components.component.Component.get_same_cmpt:7 janim.components.component.Component.walk_same_cmpt_of_descendants:6
#: of
msgid "在没有对应组件时，是否能使用先前创建过的 mock"
msgstr "Whether a previously created mock can be used when the corresponding component is unavailable"

#: janim.components.component.Component.get_same_cmpt:8 janim.components.component.Component.walk_same_cmpt_of_descendants:7
#: of
msgid "在没有对应组件时，是否基于 :meth:`~.Item.astype` 创建 mock"
msgstr "Whether to create a mock based on :meth:`~.Item.astype` when the corresponding component is unavailable"

#: ../../source/janim/components/component.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr "Returns"

#: janim.components.component.Component.get_same_cmpt:9 of
msgid "得到的组件，若 ``create_mock=False``，则可能返回 ``None``"
msgstr "The resulting component; may return ``None`` if ``create_mock=False``"

#: janim.components.component.Component.walk_same_cmpt_of_self_and_descendants:1 of
msgid "遍历该组件自身，以及所在物件的后代物件中的同类组件，默认不会创建 mock"
msgstr ""
"Traverse this component and the corresponding components in the descendant items of its containing item. By default, no "
"mocks are created."

#: janim.components.component.Component.walk_same_cmpt_of_self_and_descendants:3 of
msgid "若设置了 ``root_only`` 或 ``self.bind`` 无效则会忽略后代组件"
msgstr "If ``root_only`` is set or ``self.bind`` is invalid, descendant components are ignored."

#: janim.components.component.Component.walk_same_cmpt_of_self_and_descendants:5 of
msgid "是否忽略后代组件，仅 ``yield`` 自己"
msgstr "Whether to ignore descendant components and only ``yield`` this component"

#: janim.components.component.Component.walk_same_cmpt_of_self_and_descendants:7 of
msgid "其余参数请参考 :meth:`walk_same_cmpt_of_descendants` 的文档"
msgstr "For the remaining parameters, see the documentation for :meth:`walk_same_cmpt_of_descendants`."

#: janim.components.component.Component.walk_same_cmpt_of_descendants:1 of
msgid "遍历所在物件的后代物件中的同类组件，默认不会创建 mock"
msgstr ""
"Traverse the corresponding components in the descendant items of the containing item. By default, no mocks are created."

#: janim.components.component.Component.walk_same_cmpt_of_descendants:8 of
msgid "遍历是否不保证顺序，若指定，对于复杂结构的性能会更佳"
msgstr ""
"Whether to allow traversal without guaranteeing order. If specified, performance may be better for complex structures."

#: janim.components.component.Component.r:1 of
msgid "所位于的物件，便于链式调用同物件下其它的组件"
msgstr "The item it resides in, facilitating chained calls to other components within the same item."

#: janim.components.component.CmptInfo:1 of
msgid "在类中定义组件需要使用该类"
msgstr "When defining components in a class, you should use this class to wrap"

#: janim.components.component.CmptInfo:5 of
msgid ""
"class MyItem(Item):\n"
"    # 错误！\n"
"    # cmpt1 = MyCmpt()\n"
"\n"
"    # 正确\n"
"    cmpt1 = CmptInfo(MyCmpt[Self])\n"
"\n"
"    # 错误！\n"
"    # cmpt2 = MyCmptWithArgs(1)\n"
"\n"
"    # 正确\n"
"    cmpt2 = CmptInfo(MyCmptWithArgs[Self], 1)"
msgstr ""
"class MyItem(Item):\n"
"    # Wrong!\n"
"    # cmpt1 = MyCmpt()\n"
"\n"
"    # Correct\n"
"    cmpt1 = CmptInfo(MyCmpt[Self])\n"
"\n"
"    # Wrong\n"
"    # cmpt2 = MyCmptWithArgs(1)\n"
"\n"
"    # Correct\n"
"    cmpt2 = CmptInfo(MyCmptWithArgs[Self], 1)"

#: janim.components.component.CmptGroup:1 of
msgid "用于将多个组件打包，使得可以同时调用"
msgstr "Used to package multiple components, allowing them to be called simultaneously"

#: janim.components.component.CmptGroup:5 of
msgid ""
"class MyItem(Item):\n"
"    stroke = CmptInfo(Cmpt_Rgbas[Self])\n"
"    fill = CmptInfo(Cmpt_Rgbas[Self])\n"
"    color = CmptGroup(stroke, fill)\n"
"\n"
"item = MyItem()\n"
"item.stroke.set(...)    # 只有 stroke 的被调用\n"
"item.color.set(...)     # stroke 和 fill 的都被调用了"
msgstr ""
"class MyItem(Item):\n"
"    stroke = CmptInfo(Cmpt_Rgbas[Self])\n"
"    fill = CmptInfo(Cmpt_Rgbas[Self])\n"
"    color = CmptGroup(stroke, fill)\n"
"\n"
"item = MyItem()\n"
"item.stroke.set(...)    # Only the method of stroke be called\n"
"item.color.set(...)     # the methods of stroke and fill are both called"

#~ msgid "``at_item``: 这个组件对象是属于哪个物件对象的"
#~ msgstr "``at_item``: To which item object this component object belongs"

#~ msgid "详见： :meth:`~.Item.broadcast_refresh_of_component`"
#~ msgstr "See  :meth:`~.Item.broadcast_refresh_of_component`"
